        "@value": "Behrooz Mihankhah Ensemble with Alison Enriquez - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "HJF is taking to the road this winter as part of our Community Series initiative, bring world-class jazz beyond HRM into communities across Nova Scotia and we are delighted to be coming to the Kings Theatre Live At Lunch Series with ECMA-nominated pianist Behrooz Mihankhah and his ensemble."
      }
    ],
