        "@value": "SOS - The ABBA Experience - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "From the killer vocals and harmonies classic of Agnetha and Frida, to the intricate piano and rhythmic guitar of Benny and Bjorn, to the rich backup vocal layers performed by the other talented members, this ten-piece band will deliver an authentic experience like no other!"
      }
    ],
