        "@value": "OVERLAP - Satellite Théâtre - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Both a love letter and an uncompromising critique of Acadian culture and the city of Moncton, Overlap is author Céleste Godin’s first full-length play. Created in a language that is at once personal, dense with insight, and bursting with humanity."
      }
    ],
