        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "It's a very special evening of music with the Annapolis West Education Centre student band. They will be joined by members of the AWEC Drama Group, the Annapolis Basin Community Band, Annapolis Voices, the Bach Childrens Choir from Toronto, Noah Scanlan, and the Taproom Growlers."
      }
