  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/robin-the-ultimate-robin-williams-tribute-experience/event_239129_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/robin-the-ultimate-robin-williams-tribute-experience/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/ROB.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/robin-the-ultimate-robin-williams-tribute-experience/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ROBIN: THE ULTIMATE ROBIN WILLIAMS TRIBUTE EXPERIENCE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='inner-wrap' class='wrap hfeed kt-clear'> <div id='primary' class='content-area'> <div class='content-container site-container'> <div class='content-wrap'> <article id='post-17304' class='entry content-bg single-entry post-17304 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry'> <div class='entry-content-wrap'> <div class='entry-content single-content'> <div data-testid='richTextElement'> <p>An incredible live reincarnation of one of the greatest comedic icons of all time — <strong>Robin Williams</strong>!</p> <p>Starring <strong>Roger Kabler</strong> from New York City, this show pays tribute to the award-winning movie actor and stand-up comic, largely considered as one of America’s greatest impressionists. Making its Canadian premiere, this has become one of the hottest shows in the USA, selling out major venues everywhere. Roger Kabler performed as one of the cast members of the Carol Burnett Show in the 90’s.</p> <p>If you’ve never had the chance to see what it was like to see Robin Williams in concert, now is the time!</p> <div id='content' class='eleven columns'> <section id='post-10795' class='single post-10795 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-home-page category-live-performances'> <article class='entry-post clearfix'> <div class='entry-content clearfix'> <div class='entry-summary'> <p><strong>Praise for the show:<br /> </strong>“You’ll laugh, you’ll cry — A brilliant one-man theatre masterpiece.” – Los Angeles Times<br /> “Roger’s Robin Williams impression is extraordinary as his face seems to “morph” and he becomes Robin onstage.” – Boston Globe<br /> “Roger freaked the audience out. He was Robin in the flesh. You’d think he was channeling Robin.” – San Diego Union-Tribune<br /> “Astonishing.” – New York Post</p> </div> </div> </article> </section> </div> </div> </div> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><strong> $55</strong></p> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em><br /> <a href='https://tickets.kingstheatre.ca/TheatreManager/1/login?membershiptypes'><strong>Royalty Card holders get 10% off</strong></a></p> <p>King’s Theatre is committed to making live performances accessible to all audiences. If cost is a barrier please contact our Box Office for Bursary Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.<br /> Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian when attending a King’s Theatre event</strong></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> <p><iframe title='The Ultimate Robin Williams Tribute Experience Promo' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/qWclnhvhdLw?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
