        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "THE O'BRIEN FAMILY - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "An O’Brien Family show features the usual family-band fare: vocal harmonies, generous humour, and an occasional bass solo. It could be another four years before they’re all back on the same stage together, so don’t miss the opportunity to spend an amazing lunch hour with the family!"
      }
    ],
