        "@value": "LOS PRIMOS - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CELEBRATING 25 YEARS OF CUBAN MUSIC! Join Los Primos for the 25 year anniversary celebration this year of traditional Cuban music reinvented with a juxtaposition of musical genres they call “Fision”. Performed by some of the main players in the Los Primos project over the years, young and old together to take Cuban music in […]"
      }
    ],
