  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/alabama-zac-brown-double-tribute/event_239756_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/alabama-zac-brown-double-tribute/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/1W3A0690-Edit-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/alabama-zac-brown-double-tribute/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ALABAMA &amp; ZAC BROWN DOUBLE TRIBUTE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <div class='elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-188a402' data-id='188a402' data-element_type='column'> <div class='elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated'> <div class='elementor-widget-wrap'> <div class='elementor-element elementor-element-db5b06d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor' data-id='db5b06d' data-element_type='widget' data-widget_type='text-editor.default'> <div class='elementor-widget-container'> <p>Attending a show paying tribute to the greats – Alabama and Zac Brown – is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. To enjoy note-for-note covers of their mega hits goes beyond nostalgia. It’s like you’re re-living the moments or seeing the bands perform live.</p> <p>Mountain Music and Chicken Fried feature Grammy Award-Winning Artists Alabama and Zac Brown respectively, in one tribute show. The kind of bands for which fans could spend hours in the queue for a front-row spot and admirers could catch their matchless vibe by merely watching on screen.</p> <p><strong>“Mountain Music” The Most-Awaited Alabama Tribute</strong></p> <p>Mountain music is a much-needed tribute to Alabama. The band sold 75 million albums with over 40 #1 hit songs. The band had its most significant success in the 1980s, with over 27 top hits, seven multi-platinum albums, and over 200 awards. They also received a Hollywood Star on the walk of fame. The blue-collar southern rock guitar, the fiddle, and all the hits are part of the show.</p> <p><strong>“Chicken Fried”- North America’s Most Celebrated Tribute to The Zac Brown Band</strong></p> <p>Zac Brown is one of the sharpest minds in today’s generation of artists. The band has released six studio albums, two live albums, one greatest-hits album, and two extended plays. The band has sold millions of records and charted sixteen singles with thirteen #1 hits. This stellar act sings and performs Zac Brown like no other tribute.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$45 Adults<br /> </strong></li> <li><strong>$10 Youth</strong></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em><br /> <a href='https://tickets.kingstheatre.ca/TheatreManager/1/login?membershiptypes'><strong>Royalty Card holders get 10% off</strong></a></p> <p>King’s Theatre is committed to making live performances accessible to all audiences. If cost is a barrier please contact our Box Office for Bursary Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.<br /> </strong>Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian when attending a King’s Theatre event</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> <p><iframe title='Embou Productions present tribute to Zac Brown / Alabama 2023' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/a9LLbEQvCGI?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'></div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
    ],
