    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Annual General Meeting"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>The King&#8217;s Theatre Society hosts its Annual General Meeting at 7pm on Tuesday April 2 at King&#8217;s Theatre.</strong></p> <p>The agenda will include reports on the 2023 year, the audited financial statements, and the election of the Board of Directors.</p> <p>Notice that there will be a motion to change the Term of Office clause in the by-laws to read:<br /> <em>The term of office for Directors shall be for two years, for a maximum of</em><br /> <em>eight years with the exception of the past Chair and past Treasurer who</em><br /> <em>may serve for an additional year as an ex-officio, non-voting member of the</em><br /> <em>Board.</em></p> <p>Donor-Members in good standing are welcome to vote, as well as to put their name forward to serve on the Board of Directors. A Donation of $25 or more constitute Membership, and is eligible for a tax receipt. <a href='https://tickets.kingstheatre.ca/TheatreManager/1/login?donationcampaigns'>Click here to donate.</a></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2024-4-2T19:00-4::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2024-4-2T23:59-4::00"
      }
