        "@value": "The Odd Couple (Female Version) - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Annapolis District Drama Group present THE ODD COUPLE (FEMALE VERSION) by Neil Simon Directed by Miles Leahy May 10 & 11 @ 7:30pm and May 12 @ 2:00pm Unger and Madison are at it again! Florence Unger and Olive Madison, that is, in Neil Simon’s hilarious contemporary comic classic: the female version of The […]"
      }
