    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'> <div class='xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a'> <div dir='auto'>The 15th Festival of 10-Minute Plays will be on stage at King&#8217;s Theatre June 21-23. It promises to be a blast, so don&#8217;t miss it!</div> </div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a'> <div dir='auto'></div> <div dir='auto'>Directors include <strong>Dany Rousseau, Tracy Summerville, Kelley Pozzolo, AC Silver, Verilea Ellis, Anastacia DesLauriers, Dawn Scott, and Shaeralee McCutcheon.</strong> Produced with the assistance of the Annapolis District Drama Group and local cast and crew.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a'> <div dir='auto'></div> <div dir='auto'>The eight plays chosen for 2024 are:</div> </div> </div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'></div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'> <div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>Faded Love</b> by <b>Gene DeJoie</b>, Sherman Oaks, CA</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>Godot&#8217;s Eternal Taxi Service</b> by <b>JJ Steinfeld</b>, Charlottetown, PEI</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>Lady Bay</b> by <b>Scott Campbell</b>, Kentville, NS</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>Nobody Here</b> by <b>Jill Harland</b>, Toronto, ON</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>The Appointment</b> by <b>Bruce</b> <b>Deveau</b>, Amesbury, MA</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>The Future is Ours</b> by <b>Paul Bowman</b>, New Albany, IN</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>To Canterbury They Went</b>  by <b>Dianne Sposito,</b> New York, NY</div> <div id='ydp192e3ffdyiv4938103688ydpe3d3c5c1yiv9967741120ydp65d3adb1yiv9020959378ydp992bac4yiv7191803128ydpafc1e072yiv1490544958ydpe07aff4byiv7325723789ydpbd14ffd1yiv7277444017ydpd77ba417yiv4716487358ydp5fb584e7yiv0298599009ydp362d5acyiv3624442809ydp16a44c31yiv1688608555m_1348619126567051742yiv8796308647yui_3_16_0_ym19_1_1519918533400_43558' dir='ltr'><b>Walking the Walk</b> by <b>Seth Freeman</b>, Pacific Palisades, CA</div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $18</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $12</strong></li> </ul> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>King’s Theatre is committed to making live performances accessible to all audiences. If cost is a barrier please contact our Box Office for Bursary Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.<br /> </strong>Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian when attending a King’s Theatre event</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> <p><strong> </strong></p> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'></div> </div> </div> </div> "
