  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/thane-dunn-elvis-christmas-special/event_240909_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/thane-dunn-elvis-christmas-special/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/ElvisAlohaBillboard.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/thane-dunn-elvis-christmas-special/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THANE DUNN&#039;S ELVIS CHRISTMAS SPECIAL"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Imagine Elvis Presley’s legendary “Aloha From Hawaii” satellite telecast and his Christmas Classics mixed together in one over the top World class show that will get everyone into the Christmas spirit, Elvis-style.</strong></p> <p>Watched by over 1 Billion people worldwide, Thane Dunn &amp; the Cadillac Kings will be recreating pinnacle parts of the Aloha From Hawaii satellite telecast. From ‘Blue Suede Shoes’ to ‘Steamroller Blues’, ‘My Way’ and many more along with classic Elvis Christmas hits you know and love.</p> <p><strong>Two Time World Champion Thane Dunn and his Cadillac Kings are an Atlantic Canada favourite.</strong> Thane is known worldwide as one of the best in the business – so close to the real thing that he is actually endorsed by several people who worked and performed with the real Elvis. His shows are loved by young and old and are extremely fun and high energy.</p> <p>A night that truly brings the entire family together at the Christmas season and is guaranteed to become a family tradition. Make sure and get your tickets while they last!</p> <div> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$55 Adults</strong></li> <li><strong>$25 Youth</strong></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em></p> <p><strong>Reserve your tickets online or at the Box Office.</strong></p> <p>King’s Theatre is committed to making live performances accessible to all audiences. If cost is a barrier please contact our Box Office for Bursary Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.<br /> </strong></p> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div></div> <div></div> <div> <p><iframe title='Thane Dunn   Elvis on Tour   Promo Video' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/WsphRd7O8VM?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> <div></div> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
