    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                For over three decades, Joel Plaskett has proven himself a spinning wheel of reinvention. The Nova Scotia songwriter’s eclectic body of work reveals a restless and playful spirit, always transforming and expanding. Don’t miss his incredible solo show!\n\nTickets: $50 + hst\nContact: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.\n\n\n\nClick here for King’s Ticket policies\n\n\n\n \n \n            "
