        "@value": "AUDITIONS FOR GREASE SINGALONG SOCKHOP - King&#039;s Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Movie fans are invited to an all-new, immersive sing-along experience with the classic, feature-length film. Sing, dance & joke along with this smash-hit musical rom-com. Summer Nights, Greased Lightning, Hopelessly Devoted and We Go Together, are just a few of the melodies you can expect to make this night one you don't want to miss."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en-US"
      }
    ]
  },
