        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CHRIS FUNK: THE WONDERIST - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Chris Funk’s show is an engaging multimedia experience that has audiences talking and scratching their heads for years to come. Finally, a magic show with live music! Chris has pioneered the use of instruments like the violin, guitar, sax, and more in his illusions. Throughout the show he shares his story, tying in his passion for music and magic - garnering standing ovations and a reputation for excellence."
      }
