        "@value": "2025-5-4T23:59-4:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AUDITIONS FOR YCP's ALICE THROUGH THE LOOKING GLASS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                \n\nAUDITIONS for Young Company Production’s ‘Alice Through the Looking Glass’, Directed by Heather Hiscock.\nAudition Dates: \n\nSunday May 4, 11am-1pm\nThursday May 8, 4-6 pm\n\nLocation: King’s Theatre\nAbout the Show: ‘Alice Through the Looking Glass’ is a whimsical sequel to Lewis Carroll’s beloved tale! It will take the audience on a fantastical journey through a mirror world filled with quirky characters and delightful adventures. Join Alice as she encounters the Red Queen, the White Knight, and the Jabberwocky in a story that explores themes of identity, imagination, and the passage of time.\nPerformances at King’s Theatre October 18& 19.\nAudition Requirements: Ages 5-17. All backgrounds are welcomed. Be ready to perform a cold reading from the script. Scripts will be provided!\nWe look forward to seeing you bring your imagination to life in this enchanting production!\n\n\n            "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
