        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/shorts-logo-banner.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/kings-shorts-2025-3/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "KING&#039;S SHORTS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'> <div class='xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a'> <div dir='auto'><strong>The 16th Festival of 10-Minute Plays will be on stage at King&#8217;s Theatre June 20, 21 &amp; 22</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> <div dir='auto'></div> <div dir='auto'> <p>150 scripts were submitted from around the world, and eight plays were chosen.They are:</p> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'></div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>Echoes</strong> by Bill DiPaolo, Venice, Florida</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>Meet at the Restaurant</strong> by Brandon Hicks, Saint John, New Brunswick</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>Riley versus Riley or How to Write a Play</strong> by Johanna Keller, Syracuse, New York</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>Sweet Gypsy Rose Retirement Home for Burlesque Dancers</strong> by Brenda J. Thompson, Perotte, Nova Scotia</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>The Chairwomen</strong> by Shawn Samuelson Henry, Davidson, North Carolina</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>The Great After</strong> by Ali Joy Richardson, Halifax, Nova Scotia</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>The Prince Who &#8230;</strong> by Judd Lear Silverman, Denver, Pennsylvania</div> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'><strong>Wasted Santa</strong> by Paul Bowman, New Albany, Indiana</div> </div> <div dir='auto'></div> <div dir='auto'>The directors of the eight plays are:</div> <ul> <li>Laura Cooper-Wagner</li> <li dir='auto'>Verilea Ellis</li> <li>Ken Flett</li> <li>Jamie Keithline</li> <li>Shaeralee McCutcheon</li> <li>William McCormick</li> <li>Gregory Muszkie</li> <li dir='auto'>Dawn Scott</li> </ul> <div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <div dir='ltr' data-setdir='false'> <div class='xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a'> <div dir='auto'><strong>The festival promises to be a blast, so don&#8217;t miss it!</strong></div> </div> </div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a'></div> </div> <div id='comp-kx969csw3' class='KcpHeO tz5f0K comp-kx969csw3 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $20</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $12</strong></li> </ul> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>King’s Theatre is committed to making live performances accessible to all audiences. If cost is a barrier please contact our Box Office for Bursary Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.<br /> </strong>Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian when attending a King’s Theatre event</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> <p><iframe title='KING&#039;S SHORTS 2025- LIVE AT KING&#039;S!!' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZiResDV55CU?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'></div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
    ],
