  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/joe-h-henry/event_240965_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/joe-h-henry/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/joe.webp"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/joe-h-henry/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "JOE H HENRY"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>With a voice as powerful as a freight train, Indigenous Singer-Songwriter Joe H Henry bellows the flames of gritty Americana Roots with a whole lot of Soul.</strong></p> <div class='text-container' data-action='click-&gt;image-and-text-feature#onTextContainerClick'> <div class='text-container-wrapper complementary-section-style has-subheading has-description'> <div class='description'> <p>Known for his thoughtful lyrics, signature storytelling, and innate ability to connect with audiences from all walks of life; Henry’s well of inspiration runs deep with experiences from a homeless train hopping youth to a homesteading father of five, and you can feel it in every line he sings.</p> <p>Henry released his debut EP “Keep the Fire Burning” in Summer 2023, and has quickly become a name to watch with award nominations for 2024 Blues Recording of the Year (ECMA) and 2024 Americana Recording of the Year (Nova Scotia Music awards), as well as nominations for Indigenous Artist of the Year.</p> <p>Described as &#8220;one of the brightest new lights on the East Coast music scene&#8221; (Troy Greencorn, Stanfest/DeCoste Performing Arts Centre)<strong>.</strong></p> <p><strong>Joe H Henry is an absolute powerhouse performer. </strong>Experience Joe H. Henry and band live on stage at King&#8217;s Theatre.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <div> <p><strong>TICKETS: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$35 Adults</strong></li> <li><strong>$20 Supported* </strong></li> <li><strong>$10 Youth</strong></li> </ul> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <p><em>HST additional</em></p> <p><em>*Supported tickets are a discounted rate for those who need it, made possible thanks to our generous donors.</em></p> <p><strong>Reserve your tickets online or at the Box Office.</strong></p> <p>King’s Theatre is committed to making live performances accessible to all audiences. If cost is a barrier please contact our Box Office for Bursary Tickets: boxoffice@kingstheatre.ca or 902-532-7704.</p> <p><strong>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.<br /> </strong></p> <p><small><a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'><b>Click here for King’s Ticket Exchange policies</b></a></small></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <p><iframe title='Joe Henry- live at King’s!' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/cCK11S4KLL4?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> <div></div> <div></div> <div></div> <div> <p><iframe title='Joe H. Henry - Black Jack County Chain (Shoebox Hotel Sessions)' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/jdbxuRlh5iE?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> <div></div> <div></div> <div style='position: relative; padding-top: max(60%,326px); height: 0; width: 100%;'><iframe style='position: absolute; border: none; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;' src='https://e.issuu.com/embed.html?d=joe_h_henry_program_61425&amp;u=kingstheatreannapolisroyal' sandbox='allow-top-navigation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation allow-downloads allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-modals allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-forms' allowfullscreen='allowfullscreen'></iframe></div> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
