  {
    "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/auditions-for-charlottes-web/event_241850_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/auditions-for-charlottes-web/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/auditions.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/auditions-for-charlottes-web/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AUDITIONS FOR CHARLOTTE&#039;S WEB"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='moz-text-html' lang='x-unicode'> <div dir='ltr'> <p><strong>AUDITIONS for Annapolis District Drama Group’s December production of &#8216;Charlotte&#8217;s Web&#8217;, directed by Shaeralee McCutcheon.</strong></p> <p><i>Join us in bringing to life one of the most heartwarming and timeless tales of friendship, bravery, and the magic of words! We’re looking for enthusiastic performers of all ages to help us tell the story of Wilbur the pig, Charlotte the spider, and the barnyard crew that touched generations.</i></p> <p><strong>Audition Dates: </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Tuesday August 12 from 6 &#8211; 8pm</strong></li> <li><strong>Sunday August 17 from 10:30am &#8211; 12:30pm</strong></li> </ul> <p><strong>Location:</strong> King’s Theatre</p> <p><strong>Performances at King&#8217;s Theatre December 5-7, 2025.</strong></p> <p><strong>Audition Requirements:</strong> ALL AGES and backgrounds are welcome! Be ready to perform a cold reading from the script. Scripts will be provided. We look forward to seeing you bring your imagination to life in this enchanting production!</p> <p><strong>Parts to be Cast:</strong></p> <ul> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Fern Arable &#8211; a young girl</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>John Arable &#8211; Fern&#8217;s father</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Martha Arable &#8211; Fern&#8217;s mother</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Avery Arable &#8211; Fern&#8217;s younger brother</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Homer Zukerman &#8211; Fern&#8217;s Uncle</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Edith Zukerman &#8211; Fern&#8217;s Aunt</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Lurvy &#8211; a hired hand</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Wilbur &#8211; the pig</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Templeton &#8211; a rat</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Charlotte &#8211; the spider</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Goose, Gander, Sheep, Lamb &#8211; farm animals</span></li> <li class='tm6'><span class='tm7'>Chorus &#8211; 3 narrators</span></li> </ul> </div> </div> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
