        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CHRIS RICKETTS & FRIENDS: SEA SHANTY SHOW - King's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Internationally acclaimed 21st century shanty singer, Chris Ricketts of the UK, with Annapolis Royal's own Ray Balcom and Maurice LeClair, rising stars in the East Coast Sea Shanty scene. He will also be joined by Tony Trimper, also known as Callehan, and his band. It's a night you won't want to miss!"
      }
    ],
