        "@value": "From the Annapolis Valley of Nova Scotia, brothers Allan Spinney (on guitar and vocals) and Rick Spinney (on banjo and vocals) debuted their band in 1991. Known as Canada’s International Bluegrass Band, they featured a tight brother duet vocal style that was immediately recognized for its energetic and distinctive sound."
      }
    ],
