        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Thrilling Canadian pianist Tong Wang is a dynamic artist whose work spans styles, genres, and communities. A prizewinner of the International Chopin Golden Ring Competition and recipient of the Queen’s Golden Jubilee Medal of Performing Arts."
      }
