  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242309_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/banff-mountain-film-festival/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-2.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BANFF MOUNTAIN FILM FESTIVAL"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <h5 style='text-align: left;'><strong>For the first time in its 50 year history, the Banff Mountain Film Festival World Tour comes to Annapolis Royal!!!</strong></h5> <p style='text-align: left;'>Banff Mountain Film Festival is one of the largest and most prestigious mountain festivals in the world. Hot on the heels of the Festival that is held every fall in beautiful Banff, Alberta, the Banff Mountain Film Festival World Tour hits the road. With stops planned in over 600 communities and more than 40 countries across the globe, the Banff World Tour celebrates amazing achievements in outdoor storytelling and film-making worldwide.</p> <p style='text-align: left;'>Discover the world’s wildest places on screen — from towering peaks to untamed rivers, from life-changing expeditions, to edge-of-your-seat action.</p> <p style='text-align: left;'><strong>THANK YOU TO OUR OFFICIAL SPONSOR</strong></p> <p><img class='alignnone wp-image-242310' src='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/still-fired-300x300.jpg' alt='' width='196' height='196' /></p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><br /> <strong>$25.00 Adult</strong><br /> <strong>$15.00 Youth (under 18)</strong><br /> HST additional</p> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <p><iframe title='BANFF MOUNTAIN WORLD FILM FESTIVAL 2026- AT KING&#039;S!' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/26-Yaq68Sv4?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-2-1T14:00-4::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-2-1T23:59-4::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242459_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/next-gen-theatre-workshop-4/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/next-gen-banner-1-scaled.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "NEXT GEN THEATRE WORKSHOP"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Are you a young person wanting to explore the magical world of theatre? <span class='xv78j7m' spellcheck='false'>THE NEXT GEN THEATRE WORKSHOPS</span> are here!!! <strong>A series of FREE workshops for youth aged 8-17 who are interested in learning all about Theatre — both on stage and backstage.</strong></p> <p><strong>The workshops will take place every Tuesday for 5:30-7:30pm, January 13 to June 2, on the King’s Theatre stage.</strong> While participation in ALL workshops is not mandatory, it is highly recommended as they will all be interconnected. Space is limited, so register today.</p> <p>Participants will learn theatre skills, self confidence, and how to work together in ensemble. Each workshop will focus on a different area of theatre. Topics to be covered include Acting, Story Telling, Improvisation, Directing, Movement, Voice, Production, Stage Tech, and so much more!</p> <p><strong>The workshop series will conclude with a SHOWCASE PERFORMANCE at King’s Theatre on June 13.</strong></p> <p><em>Presented by King’s Theatre in partnership with <span class='xv78j7m' spellcheck='false'>Young Company Productions Association</span> with support from the <span class='xv78j7m' spellcheck='false'>Canada Post</span> Community Foundation.</em></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-2-3T17:30-4::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
