    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Choral"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='ipc-metadata-list-item__content-container'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base sc-ac2b5e16-0 deDizX' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='cpx-bottomMargin-lg'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_container__ftjgX'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_detailsContainer__2seki'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_ctaAndDetails__BpCFb'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_genreContainer__qEtwh MovieSelectedDetails_movieDetail__8XtgT'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'>1916. As war rages on the Western Front, the Choral Society in Ramsden, Yorkshire has lost most of its men to the army. The Choral&#8217;s ambitious committee, determined to press ahead, decides to recruit local young males to swell their ranks. They must also engage a new chorus master, and despite their suspicions that he has something to hide, their best bet seems to be Dr. Henry Guthrie (Ralph Fiennes) &#8212; driven, uncompromising, and recently returned from a career in Germany. As conscription papers start to arrive, the whole community discovers that the best response to the chaos that is laying waste to their lives is to make music together.</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <ul> <li><strong>Stars: </strong>Taylor Uttley, Ralph Fiennes, Emily Fairn</li> <li><strong><strong>Director: </strong></strong>Nicholas Hytner</li> <li><strong><strong>Writers: </strong></strong>Alan Bennett</li> </ul> <p><strong>Genre:</strong> <span class='cpx-body' data-testid='genres'>Drama/ History/ Music/ Romance/ War</span><br /> <strong>Duration:</strong> 1<span class='cpx-body' data-testid='movie-length'>h 48min</span><br /> <strong>Rating:</strong> 14A</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><br /> <strong>$11.95 Adult</strong><br /> <strong>$7.95 Youth (under 18)</strong><br /> (HST additional)</p> <ul class='p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested' data-stringify-type='ordered-list' data-list-tree='true' data-indent='0' data-border='0'> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'></li> </ul> </div> <p><iframe title='The Choral - Official Trailer - Only In Cinemas November 7' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/EYMIhLwiHVs?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
      }
