    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GIRLS NITE OUT"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><em>All Funny, All Female, Comedy Night of Improv and Stand Up featuring Elvira Kurt and Friends.</em></p> <p>Featuring a cast of Canadian Comedy Award winners, Second City alum and CBC comedy darlings, Girls Nite Out with Elvira Kurt includes stand-up performances and improvisation that will have you in stitches. It’s a night of laughter and celebration led by some of Canada’s funniest ladies!</p> <p>Enjoy a night of laughter and celebration! The fearless and fabulous<strong> Elvira Kurt </strong>will be joined on stage by award-winning comedians <strong>Jennine Profeta, Diana Frances, and Karen Parker</strong> for a night of stand-up and improvisation sure to leave you in stitches.</p> <p><em>Funny, smart and energetic. This show was everything I like in my comedy.  </em>– Norm Foster</p> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>ALL TICKETS:</strong><strong>  </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>$45 + HST</strong></li> </ul> <p><em><strong>* Intended for mature audiences.</strong></em></p> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><iframe title='Girls Nite Out 2025/26 Promo' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/FE3rfpJEEZM?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
