  {
    "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/event_242208_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/new-events/alfie-zappacosta/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/COE-Alfie-Zappacosta.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://kingstheatre.ca/events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ALFIE ZAPPACOSTA"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Alfie Zappacosta </strong>is one of Canada’s most distinctive and enduring vocal talents, celebrated for his powerful voice, masterful songwriting, and sophisticated musicianship. Emerging in the 1980s with a string of chart-topping hits, Zappacosta quickly became known for blending pop, jazz, and rock influences into a refined sound that set him apart from his contemporaries. His self-titled debut album earned him a JUNO Award, while iconic songs like &#8216;We Should Be Lovers&#8217; and &#8216;Start Again&#8217; cemented his place in Canadian pop culture.Over the decades, Zappacosta has continued to evolve artistically, releasing critically acclaimed albums that showcase his expressive phrasing, rich arrangements, and introspective lyricism. His song &#8216;Overload&#8217;, featured on the multi-platinum Dirty Dancing soundtrack, introduced his music to international audiences and remains a fan favourite. Whether performing with a full band or in intimate acoustic settings, Zappacosta captivates audiences with his effortless command of melody and emotional depth. With a career spanning more than 40 years, Alfie Zappacosta stands as a consummate performer whose artistry continues to shine brightly on the Canadian and international stage.</p> <div class='row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12 left'> <div class='vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column has-animation padding-3-percent inherit_tablet inherit_phone triggered-animation animated-in' data-padding-pos='top-bottom' data-has-bg-color='false' data-bg-color='' data-bg-opacity='1' data-animation='fade-in-from-bottom' data-delay='100'> <div class='vc_column-inner'> <div class='wpb_wrapper'> <div class='wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1653346740665'> <div class='wpb_wrapper'> <ul> <li class='moz-quote-pre'>JUNO Award-Winner &#8211; &#8216;Album of The Year&#8217; and &#8216;Most Promising Male Vocalist&#8217;</li> <li class='moz-quote-pre'>American Music Award for &#8216;Most Popular Album of The Year&#8217;</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><strong>  </strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $35</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $10</strong></li> <li>HST additional</li> </ul> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><iframe title='Alfie Zappacosta (The Acoustic Duo Experience)' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/SftlxIrjcqg?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
