        "@value": "KING&#039;S SHORTS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p class='tm9 Title'><span class='tm11'>The 17th </span><strong><span class='tm12'>King’s Shorts Festival of Ten Minute Plays </span></strong><span class='tm11'>will be hosted by King’s Theatre in </span><span class='tm11'>Annapolis Royal, Nova Scotia on </span><strong><span class='tm12'>June 19, 20 &amp; 21, 2026. </span></strong></p> <p class='tm9 Title'>Mark your calendars and check back for details!</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Adults: $22</strong></li> <li><strong>Youth: $10 (Under 18)</strong></li> </ul> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> "
      }
    ],
