      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span class='x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xlh3980 xvmahel x1n0sxbx x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u' dir='auto'>Don&#8217;t miss Ashley MacIsaac&#8217;s Celtic Christmas Ceilidh. Join Ashley MacIsaac and friends for a wonderful evening of tunes that are bound to get you in the holiday spirit!</span></p> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong><span class='tm9'>TICKETS</span></strong><br /> <strong><span class='tm9'>Adults $50</span></strong><br /> <strong>Supported $30</strong><br /> <strong><span class='tm9'>Youth: $15</span></strong><br /> <em><span class='tm14'>HST additional</span></em></p> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div style='position: relative; padding-top: max(60%,326px); height: 0; width: 100%;'><iframe style='position: absolute; border: none; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;' src='https://e.issuu.com/embed.html?d=ashley_macisaac_program_-_12-20-25&amp;u=kingstheatreannapolisroyal' sandbox='allow-top-navigation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation allow-downloads allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-modals allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-forms' allowfullscreen='allowfullscreen'></iframe></div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
