    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Royal Ballet: The Nutcracker 2025"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='sc-1aynn5k-2 bMqLa-D'> <div class='sc-175uz2x-13 iRDmiC'> <div class='sc-175uz2x-14 JljXu'> <div class='sc-175uz2x-274 hWDdHY'> <p>Peter Wright’s much-loved production for <a href='https://www.rbo.org.uk/about/the-royal-ballet'>The Royal Ballet</a>, with gorgeous period designs by Julia Trevelyan Oman, keeps true to the spirit of this festive ballet classic, combining the thrill of the fairy tale with spectacular dancing. It is the perfect Christmas treat for all the family.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='sc-1aynn5k-2 bMqLa-D'> <div class='sc-175uz2x-13 iRDmiC'> <div class='sc-175uz2x-14 JljXu'> <div class='sc-175uz2x-274 hWDdHY'> <p>Discover more about the brilliance of <a href='https://www.rbo.org.uk/creative-spotlight-tchaikovsky'>Tchaikovsky</a>’s score, and learn about Clara and her enchanted Nutcracker fighting the Mouse King and visiting the Sugar Plum Fairy in the glittering Kingdom of Sweets.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id='i8e4vmc5' class='BaOVQ8 tz5f0K i8e4vmc5 wixui-rich-text' data-testid='richTextElement'> <p><strong>RUNTIME:</strong> 2h 25m</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:<br /> Adult $16</strong><strong>.95<br /> Youth: $7.95<br /> </strong><em>HST additional</em></p> </div> <div class='style__notes___25v7J'> <div class='main-title'> <div class='TitleBlock__TitleMetaDataContainer-sc-1nlhx7j-2 hWHMKr'> <ul> <li style='list-style-type: none;'> <ul> <li><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime. Please arrive early.</em></li> <li><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><iframe title='The Royal Ballet: The Nutcracker Cinema Trailer' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/-gpHw-cXgik?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> <div style='position: relative; padding-top: max(60%,326px); height: 0; width: 100%;'><iframe style='position: absolute; border: none; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;' src='https://e.issuu.com/embed.html?d=nutcracker_2025_s2s_program_-_12-21-25&amp;u=kingstheatreannapolisroyal' sandbox='allow-top-navigation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation allow-downloads allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-modals allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-forms' allowfullscreen='allowfullscreen'></iframe></div> "
