    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='ipc-metadata-list-item__content-container'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base sc-ac2b5e16-0 deDizX' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content ipc-html-content--base' role='presentation'> <div class='ipc-html-content-inner-div' role='presentation'> <div class='cpx-bottomMargin-lg'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_container__ftjgX'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_detailsContainer__2seki'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_ctaAndDetails__BpCFb'> <div class='MovieSelectedDetails_genreContainer__qEtwh MovieSelectedDetails_movieDetail__8XtgT'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'>In an afterlife where souls have one week to decide where to spend eternity, Joan is faced with the impossible choice between the man she spent her life with and her first love, who died young and has waited decades for her to arrive.</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='VideoBillboardContent_expanderWrap__Zcq_E cpx-bottomMargin-xxl'> <div id='movie-details-expander'> <div class='AdditionalDetails_contentBox__pAxPZ'><img class='alignnone wp-image-242436 size-medium' src='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/kingweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Eternity-ratings-300x74.png' alt='' width='300' height='74' /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <div class='drawer'> <div class='score-wrap'> <div class='description-wrap'> <div data-adsmediascorecardmanager='description'> <ul> <li><strong>Stars: </strong>Miles Teller, Elizabeth Olsen, Callum Turner</li> <li><strong><strong>Director: </strong></strong>David Freyne</li> <li><strong><strong>Writers: </strong></strong>Patrick Cunnane, David Freyne</li> </ul> <p><strong>Genre: </strong>Comedy, Romance, <span class='cpx-body' data-testid='genres'>Drama</span><br /> <strong>Duration:</strong> 1<span class='cpx-body' data-testid='movie-length'>h 54min</span><br /> <strong>Rating:</strong> PG</p> <p><strong>TICKETS:</strong><br /> <strong>$11.95 Adult</strong><br /> <strong>$7.95 Youth (under 18)</strong><br /> (HST additional)</p> <ul class='p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested' data-stringify-type='ordered-list' data-list-tree='true' data-indent='0' data-border='0'> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Doors open 45 minutes before showtime.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>King’s Theatre is committed to accessibility. If price is a barrier to attending, please request a ‘Bursary Ticket’ at the Box Office.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Tickets are not refundable for cash, but can be exchanged for credit with a minimum of 48 hours notice. Credits are valid for 12 months.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>All persons require a ticket; we do not allow babes in arms. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a guardian.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>Outside food and beverages may not be brought into the theatre.</em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'><em>For more information about Theatre policies, click <a href='https://www.kingstheatre.ca/about/ticket-info/'>here.</a></em></li> <li data-stringify-indent='0' data-stringify-border='0'></li> </ul> </div> <p><iframe title='Eternity | Official Trailer 2 HD | A24' width='1080' height='608' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzkoY6hUvQQ?feature=oembed'  allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> "
